N        EQU   16
KEY      EQU   1000
INFO     EQU   1100
K        EQU   1200
         ORIG  3000
START    LDA   K           Q1. Initialize.
         STA   KEY+N+1     KN+1 ← K.
         ENT1  -1-N        i ← −1.
3H       INC1  2           Q3. Advance. (twice)
         CMPA  KEY+N,1     Q2. Compare.
         JE    4F          To Q4 if K = Ki.
         CMPA  KEY+N+1,1   Q2. Compare. (next)
         JNE   3B          To Q3 if K ≠ Ki+1.
         INC1  1           Advance i.
4H       J1NP  SUCCESS     Q4. End of file?
FAILURE  EQU   *           Exit if not in table.
         ENTA  0
         HLT
SUCCESS  LDA   INFO+N,1
         HLT
         END   START
